From: Configuration <local@nixos>
Subject: [PATCH] gvc: guard a missing PulseAudio active profile

PipeWire PulseAudio can transiently report a card with ports but no profiles
during startup. In that state pa_card_info.active_profile is NULL. Do not
dereference it while updating GNOME Shell's volume control state.

--- a/subprojects/gvc/gvc-mixer-control.c
+++ b/subprojects/gvc/gvc-mixer-control.c
@@ -2611 +2611,2 @@ update_card (GvcMixerControl      *control,
-                is_default = (g_strcmp0 (pi.name, info->active_profile->name) == 0);
+                is_default = (info->active_profile != NULL &&
+                              g_strcmp0 (pi.name, info->active_profile->name) == 0);
@@ -2649 +2650,2 @@ update_card (GvcMixerControl      *control,
-        gvc_mixer_card_set_profile (card, info->active_profile->name);
+        if (info->active_profile != NULL)
+                gvc_mixer_card_set_profile (card, info->active_profile->name);
